## Docker

Build and run the image:

```bash
docker build -t [[ distribution_name ]] .
docker run --rm [[ distribution_name ]]
```

[% if include_cli %]
Pass CLI commands and arguments after the image name:

```bash
docker run --rm [[ distribution_name ]] hello World
```
